{"id": "52513", "title": "神之欲", "author": "泡沫梨", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 130, "available": 11, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/52/52513.htm", "intro": "序章 神的欲望 【高H】\r\n\r\n　　夜色正浓，月如钩。\r\n　　\r\n　　“离儿，离儿……是我不好，你不要离开我，离儿……”总是如神祗般高尚而不可冒犯的男子，仿佛绝望又似满怀希冀地呢喃著，哀求著。而他那双可以顷刻间翻云覆雨的手，却在无情地撕扯著女人的衣服。“离儿，我知道你不会忘了我的，我知道……你是我的，你只能是我的！”", "base": "files/article/html/52/52513", "chapters": [{"title": "序章", "file": "7429880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1. 与谁同醉采香归", "file": "7429883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2.魅", "file": "7429885.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3.发泄（高H，慎）", "file": "7429888.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4.幻影还是心魔？", "file": "7429890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5.春药？", "file": "7429892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6.楼主美人是……处男？", "file": "7429894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7.摘星", "file": "7429896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8.孟湘初遇", "file": "7429898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9.美人出浴图", "file": "7429900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10.山中色鬼", "file": "7429903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11.为谁蛊惑", "file": "7429908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12．顾家公子？", "file": "7429909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13.无痕留影", "file": "7429912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14.是结是解？", "file": "7429913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15.结界，要我的命还是要你的身？", "file": "7429916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16.破身之一", "file": "7429918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17.破身之二", "file": "7429919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18.破身之三", "file": "7429921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19.破身（激H，慎入）", "file": "7429923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20.原荒之子", "file": "7429926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21.清醒", "file": "7429928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22.残余的温柔", "file": "7429931.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23.异变", "file": "7429933.html", "available": false